Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 02:40:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] panvk/kbase: resolve same-queue semaphore waits on the
 GPU

Waits on work previously submitted to the same queue become SYNC_WAIT64
instructions on the producer subqueues' sequence number objects in the
ring entry, instead of blocking the submitting thread until the GPU
drains. Other syncs keep the CPU wait. PANVK_KBASE_CPU_SEMAPHORE_WAITS=1
restores the previous behaviour.

